Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libqcow

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libqcow/archive/refs/tags/20260703.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libqcow-20260703-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libqcow-20260703-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libqcow-20260703-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqcow-20260703-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqcow1-20260703-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libqcow-devel-20260703-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libqcow-20260703-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libqcow)
  /usr/bin/qcowinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/qcowmount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libqcow.README
  /usr/share/doc/libqcow/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libqcow/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libqcow/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libqcow/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libqcow/QEMU Copy-On-Write file format.asciidoc
  /usr/share/doc/libqcow/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/qcowinfo.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/qcowmount.1.gz

(libqcow1)
  /usr/bin/cygqcow-1.dll

(libqcow-devel)
  /usr/include/libqcow.h
  /usr/include/libqcow/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libqcow/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libqcow/error.h
  /usr/include/libqcow/extern.h
  /usr/include/libqcow/features.h
  /usr/include/libqcow/types.h
  /usr/lib/libqcow.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libqcow.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libqcow.3.gz

(python312-libqcow)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyqcow.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

